        "claim": "More than 1 in 10 people in the UK struggled to afford period products in the last year, with other reports suggesting as high as 1 in 5 in 2023.",
        "evidence_id": "E15",
        "quote": "this figure has been as high as 1 in 5 (21%) in 2023, a 75% increase from 2022, exacerbated by the cost of living crisis"
      },
      {
        "tier": "measurable",
